<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Raining day and night</l><l>While water rise, I’m safe inside my Christ the ark.</l><l>This world is buried ’neath the dark,</l><l>I’ve stepped into the light.</l><l>His word I see, I trace the rainbow through the sky.</l><l>To Christ I come, to Christ I go.</l></lg>
</div>
